                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6333' id='765' type-v2='text' w='94285' x='2856' y='8267'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='12'>Overview</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>This dashboard provides key insights into the talent acquisition process, focusing on application volume and conversion rates at various stages of the hiring pipeline. The information below explains how each metric is calculated, helping you understand what each represents and how to interpret the data.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='77000' id='766' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='94285' x='2856' y='14600'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='77000' id='571' type-v2='text' w='46714' x='2856' y='14600'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Overall Calculations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Applications</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Total number of individuals who have applied for a position.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of unique candidates who submitted an application.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- In Review</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Number of candidates whose applications are currently under review.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of unique candidates whose application has reached the review stage.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- First Interviews</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Number of candidates who have had their first interview scheduled.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of unique candidates with a first interview appointment in the system.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Offers Initiated</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Total number of job offers initiated by the company.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of unique candidates for whom an offer has been created.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Hires</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Number of candidates who have accepted an offer and completed the onboarding process.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of unique candidates marked as hired, based on the final hire date and successful completion of onboarding.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Conversion Rates</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Conversion rates track the percentage of candidates moving from one stage of the hiring process to the next.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- % New to In Review</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage of new applicants who moved to the &quot;In Review&quot; stage.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Formula</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: (In Review Applicants / Total Applications) * 100</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- % In Review to First Interview</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage of candidates reviewed who were invited for a first interview.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Formula</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: (First Interviews / In Review Applicants) * 100</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- % Interview to Offer</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage of candidates interviewed who received a job offer.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Formula</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: (Offers Initiated / First Interviews) * 100</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- % Offer to Hire</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage of candidates who accepted their offers and were hired.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Formula</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: (Hires / Offers Initiated) * 100</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='77000' id='572' type-v2='text' w='47571' x='49570' y='14600'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Interview Conversion Rates</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Conversion rates here focus on the movement of candidates between interview stages. We focus on candidate progress, not the number of interviews cond</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>ucted.For accuracy, you can apply the following options:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>- Remove Optional Interviews</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>You can choose to exclude optional interviews from the calculation. These are interviews that are not required and may be skipped in the process. Removing them gives you a clearer view of the necessary steps candidates take.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>- Select Specific Hiring Process</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>Interview stages may differ depending on the hiring process type (e.g., different interview steps for different job roles). To get the most accurate conversion rates, select the appropriate hiring process from the options available.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>- Interview Calculations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>For each interview stage (e.g., TA Interview, Hiring Manager Interview), we count each candidate only once, regardless of how many interviews they completed at that stage.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>- Interview Conversion Rate</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>The percentage of candidates moving from one interview stage to the next.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Example</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>: From TA Interview to Hiring Manager Interview.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Formula</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='tableau book ' fontsize='11'>: (Second Interviews / First Interviews) * 100</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Source Performance</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>This section shows the performance of various sources used for hiring, as categorized by the TA Ops team.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Applications by Source</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The number of applications received from each source (e.g., job boards, referrals, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- First Interviews by Source</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The number of first interviews scheduled based on the source of application.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Hires by Source</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The number of candidates hired from each source.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Internal Candidates</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Internal candidates are identified by the &quot;Internal&quot; source category. This indicates candidates who are applying from within the organization.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Rejections &amp; Withdrawals</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Candidate Withdrawals</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The number of candidates who voluntarily withdrew from the hiring process.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of candidates who withdrew, based on withdrawal reason.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Rejections</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The number of candidates who were not selected to move forward in the hiring process.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Definition</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Count of candidates rejected, based on rejection reason.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4629ff' fontsize='12'>Diversity</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>This section highlights gender representation throughout various stages of the interview process, giving insight into diversity within the hiring pipeline.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone h='5592' id='767' type-v2='empty' w='17215' x='82214' y='533'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                  <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
